    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Wizards are students of the arcane arts who research and develop spells as academic pursuit.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Iconic Wizards</strong></b></p><ul class=\"vb-rtf-ul\"><li value=\"1\" class=\"vb-rtf-li\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Harry Dresden, The Dresden Files</span></li><li value=\"2\" class=\"vb-rtf-li\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Merlyn, Arthurian legend</span></li><li value=\"3\" class=\"vb-rtf-li\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Sparrowhawk, Earthsea</span></li><li value=\"4\" class=\"vb-rtf-li\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Sypha Belnades, Castlevania</span></li></ul><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Playing Wizard</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The wizard is a squishy blaster focused on Casting Spells. Stay in safety to Cast your Spells and discover Enemy weaknesses.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Action: </strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Cast</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Move:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Backline</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Training:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Arcana, Craft, Mysticism</span></p>",
